> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> , and if they don't already exist come up with stats for zap, and yes I want the players to survive </div> </div> </div>Zap hasn't stats, but he should rougly be able to barely survive 3 nukes after fighting 3 methusalems for 3 days in the midst of supernatural storm and an army of spirits (some summoned by him, some by the Kuei). So have fun with that.<br /> <br /> Doissetep does allow the PC to get almost any kind of mystical deus-ex-machina - including esoteric artifacts, the help of dragons and powerful elementals, angels and demons bound by oaths (and to fetishes), magical nukes, etc...all of which should require some effort to aquire from the jealous power hungry archmages.<br /> <br /> Ultimately, you decide how hard it's to dent zap.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Now is where the outline blurs into just an idea I haven't looked into it too much, and i'm not sure if it's even feasible but the awsome idea is that after the traditions revocer from winter into spring, each and every one of the end time scenarios from the Ascension book will play out one after the other, with custom victory endings, the Chronicle ends proper after Hell on Earth again with a victory option. </div> </div> </div>Ambitious. I think it's possible but would require to change more than the endings. For instance, in some scenarios &quot;the Masquerade&quot; breaks almost immediately while in others it holds up. The Technocracy doesn't have the same end in each scenario, in some it's disbanded or changes it's form, in others it's destroyed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1683,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","user":"Aleph","date":". 11-14-2018, 01:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":